# Repository-fixed line endings: every text file is LF in the index and LF
# in the working tree on every platform. JSON evidence, .io spec vectors and
# golden captures are digest-compared byte-for-byte, so a platform checkout
# must never rewrite them; source, docs and configuration follow the same
# rule so diffs and patches stay byte-stable across operating systems.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Evidence compared byte-for-byte: the strict-encoding digest and the spec
# bundle pin these files' exact bytes.
*.json text eol=lf
*.io text eol=lf
